ut/reset harness.","limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Install a stable binary and fix the track, kart, difficulty and race settings.","For code edits, obtain the matching game data and follow the C++ build instructions.","Keep a baseline driving sequence and establish explicit lap/finish detection.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Complete fixed laps and measure finish rate, lap time, collisions and recovery.","Change steering or collision behavior and compare the same kart and track.","Import a test kart or track and verify scale, materials, collision and runtime loading.","AI use and evaluation boundary","Useful for instrumented driving and asset integration, with a separate license audit for each redistributed track, character or recorded asset collection.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92,93],"evidence",{"_54":100,"_25":101},{"_54":98,"_25":99},{"_54":96,"_25":97},{"_54":94,"_25":95},"Pinned GPLv3-or-later and per-asset license scope","https://github.com/supertuxkart/stk-code/blob/2997f192e6876047909d909498dbb4810e5dbb8d/COPYING","Code and asset licensing","https://supertuxkart.net/Licensing","Official downloads","https://supertuxkart.net/Download","Official source and build guidance","https://github.com/supertuxkart/stk-code","Read the terms",[105],"licenseUrl",{"_54":102,"_25":97},"Terms category","Mixed code / asset licenses","terms","provenance","Asset license","Multiple licenses, including Creative Commons terms; inspect the asset authorship and licensing records.","assetLicense","Code license","GPLv3 or later for SuperTuxKart code; bundled components retain their own notices.","codeLicense","Get started",[119],"access",{"_54":120,"_25":99,"_121":122},"Free desktop downloads","note","Free desktop packages. Source builds also require the game data described in the build documentation.","Primary source",[126],"sourceUrl",{"_54":123,"_25":101},"Stack","C++ / 3D kart racing / Ble